(:id "signed-128/c/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "the signed-128 read/write round trip with non-default and boundary values is unproved: the 128-bit storage is serialize.h's lo/hi pair, the table header includes serialize.h only when the unit holds it, and serialize.h ships in the sibling serialize.c checkout which is absent here, so a compiled probe cannot be built or run")
